TITLE Calcite kinetics with acidic solution, Cu and Ba, 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    -water 1
KNOBS
    -iterations 500
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100
END
